<view class="card">
  <view class="row">
    <text class="label">蓝牙</text>
    <text class="value">{{statusText}}</text>
  </view>
  <view class="row" wx:if="{{deviceName}}">
    <text class="label">设备</text>
    <text class="value">{{deviceName}}</text>
  </view>
  <view class="row">
    <text class="label">解锁</text>
    <text class="value">{{unlockedText}}</text>
  </view>
  <view class="tip" wx:if="{{!connected}}">
    点下面按钮搜索并连接 ESP32. 蓝牙直连, 不用连 WiFi 热点, 手机照常上网.\n安卓手机第一次会要"定位"权限, 不给就扫不到设备.
  </view>
</view>

<view class="card">
  <view class="speed-wrap">
    <text class="speed">{{speed}}</text>
    <text class="unit">km/h</text>
  </view>
  <view class="row">
    <text class="label">转速</text>
    <text class="value">{{rpm}} RPM</text>
  </view>
  <view class="row">
    <text class="label">电压 / 电流</text>
    <text class="value">{{voltage}} V / {{current}} A</text>
  </view>
  <view class="row">
    <text class="label">485 协议车速值</text>
    <text class="value">{{protocolSpeed}}</text>
  </view>
  <view class="row" wx:if="{{errorCode}}">
    <text class="label">错误码</text>
    <text class="value">{{errorCode}}</text>
  </view>
</view>

<view class="card">
  <view class="label" style="margin-bottom:12rpx">诊断</view>
  <view class="row">
    <text class="label">V35 轮询 / 应答</text>
    <text class="value">{{qCount}} / {{aCount}}</text>
  </view>
  <view class="row">
    <text class="label">轮询速率</text>
    <text class="value">{{pollHz}}</text>
  </view>
  <view class="row">
    <text class="label">霍尔脉冲 / 间隔</text>
    <text class="value">{{pulseCount}} / {{intervalMs}} ms</text>
  </view>
  <view class="row" wx:if="{{badCs}}">
    <text class="label">校验和错帧</text>
    <text class="value">{{badCs}}</text>
  </view>
  <view class="tip">
    轮询数一直涨 = 总线通; 应答数跟着涨 = 我们答上了 (两个数应该相等);
    脉冲数不涨 = 霍尔/磁钢没信号, 车速自然是 0.
  </view>
</view>

<view class="card">
  <view class="label" style="margin-bottom:12rpx">电池</view>
  <view wx:if="{{!bmsHasData}}" class="tip">
    没收到电池报文 —— BMS 只在 V35 轮询它的时候才回话, 车得通电才行.
  </view>
  <block wx:if="{{bmsHasData}}">
    <view class="soc-wrap">
      <text class="soc">{{soc}}</text>
      <text class="soc-unit">%</text>
    </view>
    <view class="soc-bar"><view class="soc-fill" style="width:{{socWidth}}"></view></view>
    <view class="row">
      <text class="label">总电压</text>
      <text class="value">{{bmsVoltage}} V</text>
    </view>
    <view class="row">
      <text class="label">电流</text>
      <text class="value">{{bmsCurrent}} A</text>
    </view>
    <view class="row">
      <text class="label">温度</text>
      <text class="value">{{bmsTemps}}</text>
    </view>
    <view class="row" wx:if="{{cellCount}}">
      <text class="label">单体电压</text>
      <text class="value">{{cellCount}} 串 {{cellRange}}</text>
    </view>
    <view class="row" wx:if="{{bmsModel}}">
      <text class="label">电池型号</text>
      <text class="value">{{bmsModel}}</text>
    </view>
    <view class="cell-bars" wx:if="{{cellBars.length}}">
      <view class="cell-bar" wx:for="{{cellBars}}" wx:key="i">
        <view class="cell-fill" style="height:{{item.h}}"></view>
        <text class="cell-text mono">{{item.v}}</text>
      </view>
    </view>
  </block>
</view>

<view class="card">
  <view class="label" style="margin-bottom:12rpx">485 总线原始帧</view>
  <view wx:if="{{!frames.length}}" class="tip">还没收到帧 —— 车上的 ECU 得在轮询 FOC 才会出现.</view>
  <scroll-view class="log" scroll-y>
    <view wx:for="{{frames}}" wx:key="*this" class="log-line mono">{{item}}</view>
  </scroll-view>
</view>

<view class="card">
  <button class="primary" bindtap="connect" disabled="{{busy || connected}}">
    {{busy ? '连接中…' : '连接设备'}}
  </button>
  <button class="ghost" style="margin-top:16rpx" bindtap="onDisconnect" disabled="{{!connected}}">
    断开
  </button>
</view>
